    "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nThis task makes COS use the [latest lagom-pb changes](https://github.com/super-flat/lagom-pb/pull/92) to encrypt the journal. This work prepares COS for proper encryption of events to comply with GDPR/CCPA.\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\n- once lagom-pb releases, update dependency\r\n- add an env var / configuration for picking the encryptor used, but default to `NoEncryption`\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nn/a\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nrelates to https://github.com/super-flat/lagom-pb/issues/84\r\nrelates to #30 ",
